# The wrapper builds with CARGO_TARGET_DIR under the XDG cache dir, so nothing
# lands here in normal use -- this is only for a plain `cargo build` run inside
# the project by hand.
/target

# The built binary. Both packaged deployments put it beside its own sources:
# home-manager symlinks it into its own copy of this directory, and the COI
# image build installs it straight into the checkout, because xstow folded
# ~/.claude/statusline onto exactly that. So on a COI machine this really is
# a build artifact in the working tree.
/claude-statusline
